# Taste (Continuously Learned by [CommandCode][cmd])

[cmd]: https://commandcode.ai/

# git
- Include /output directory in git tracking (remove from .gitignore) so leads data is accessible from other machines. Confidence: 0.75

# testing
- Use `python -m pytest` to run tests instead of executing test files directly. Confidence: 0.70
- Investigate failing tests to identify root cause; fix code or tests rather than dismissing or skipping failures. Confidence: 0.65

# workflow
- Use dry-run or test mode with limited scope before any write operations or full execution. Confidence: 0.70
- Save plans and audit reports in /docs directory instead of .commandcode/plans/. Confidence: 0.70

